# Supply-chain hardening: refuse to resolve any npm version published less than
# 3 days (4320 min) ago, so a malicious release can be pulled before we adopt it
# (per PostHog's Shai-Hulud post-mortem, Nov 2025). Enforced only by pnpm >= 10.16
# (this package pins pnpm 10.x via package.json "packageManager"); older pnpm and
# npm ignore the key. Lives here, NOT in pnpm-workspace.yaml: Vercel installs with
# pnpm 9, which rejects a settings-only workspace file ("packages field missing").
minimum-release-age=4320
